  // APPEARANCE & BRANDING round 2: Secondary Color, Accent Color, and the
  // three Status Colors each override one CSS variable directly (no HSL
  // dark-mode derivation needed — unlike brand_color/navy above, these
  // tokens were already the SAME fixed hex in both themes before this
